{
  "id": "panch-parmeshwar",
  "lang": "hi",
  "title": "पंच परमेश्वर",
  "part": "Panch Parmeshwar · अंश",
  "author": "प्रेमचंद",
  "year": 1916,
  "source": "Wikisource, Saptasaroj. Abridged; spelling modernised and the dialogue punctuated with quotation marks.",
  "narrator": "M1",
  "durationMs": 44362,
  "audio": "/samples/panch-parmeshwar.mp3",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "जुम्मन शेख़ और अलगू चौधरी में गाढ़ी मित्रता थी।",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3097,
          "voice": "M1"
        },
        {
          "text": "साझे में खेती होती थी।",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 3497,
          "end": 5005,
          "voice": "M1"
        },
        {
          "text": "कुछ लेन-देन में भी साझा था।",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 5355,
          "end": 6813,
          "voice": "M1"
        },
        {
          "text": "एक को दूसरे पर अटल विश्वास था।",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 7203,
          "end": 9132,
          "voice": "M1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "चारों ओर से घूम-घामकर बेचारी खाला अलगू चौधरी के पास आई।",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 9962,
          "end": 13931,
          "voice": "M1"
        },
        {
          "text": "लाठी पटक दी और दम लेकर बोली,",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 14311,
          "end": 15980,
          "voice": "M1"
        },
        {
          "text": "“बेटा, तुम भी दम भर के लिए मेरी पंचायत में चले आना।”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 16220,
          "end": 18861,
          "voice": "F4",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "खाला"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "अलगू ने कहा,",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 19121,
          "end": 20013,
          "voice": "M1"
        },
        {
          "text": "“मुझे बुलाकर क्या करोगी?",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 20253,
          "end": 21430,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "अलगू"
        },
        {
          "text": "कई गाँव के आदमी तो आवेंगे ही।”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 21860,
          "end": 23484,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "अलगू"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "खाला बोली,",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 23924,
          "end": 24650,
          "voice": "M1"
        },
        {
          "text": "“अपनी विपद तो सबके आगे रो आई हूँ।",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 24910,
          "end": 26659,
          "voice": "F4",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "खाला"
        },
        {
          "text": "आने न आने का अख़्तियार उनको है।”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 27029,
          "end": 28612,
          "voice": "F4",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "खाला"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“यों आने को मैं आ जाऊँगा, मगर पंचायत में मुँह न खोलूँगा,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 29102,
          "end": 31979,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "अलगू"
        },
        {
          "text": "अलगू ने कहा।",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 32209,
          "end": 33156,
          "voice": "M1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“क्यों बेटा?”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 33426,
          "end": 33992,
          "voice": "F4",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "खाला"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“अब इसका क्या जवाब दूँ?",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 34582,
          "end": 35634,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "अलगू"
        },
        {
          "text": "जुम्मन मेरे पुराने मित्र हैं।",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 36024,
          "end": 37592,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "अलगू"
        },
        {
          "text": "उनसे बिगाड़ नहीं कर सकता।”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 37952,
          "end": 39325,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "अलगू"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "खाला ने पूछा,",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 39855,
          "end": 40566,
          "voice": "M1"
        },
        {
          "text": "“बेटा, क्या बिगाड़ के डर से ईमान की बात न कहोगे?”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 40826,
          "end": 43492,
          "voice": "F4",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "खाला"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
